# 🤖 AI Financial Research Agent

An **Agentic AI-powered Financial Research System** that automates end-to-end investment research by orchestrating multiple AI agents, financial data sources, memory modules, and verification pipelines.

The system follows a **Plan-and-Execute Agent Architecture**, enabling autonomous financial analysis through intelligent planning, tool execution, memory retrieval, report verification, and professional report generation.

Built using **Python, LangChain, Groq (Llama 3.3 70B), ChromaDB, Streamlit, Yahoo Finance, SEC EDGAR, and DuckDuckGo Search**.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Autonomous Plan-and-Execute Agent Architecture
- Company Profile Analysis
- Financial Statement Analysis
- Latest Financial News Retrieval
- SEC Filing Analysis (SEC EDGAR)
- Multi-Agent Workflow
- Three-Level Memory System
  - Short-Term Memory
  - Long-Term Memory (ChromaDB)
  - Episodic Memory
- AI-Based Report Verification
- Professional Investment Report Generation
- Streamlit Web Interface
- Automatic Report Storage
- Modular and Extensible Architecture

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

```text
                           User
                             │
                             ▼
                 Financial Research Agent
                             │
        ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐
        │                                         │
        ▼                                         ▼
 Planner Agent                          Memory System
        │                     ┌──────────┼───────────┐
        ▼                     ▼          ▼           ▼
 Creates Execution Plan   Short-Term  Long-Term  Episodic
        │                  Memory      Memory     Memory
        ▼
 Executor Agent
        │
        ▼
 Tool Registry
        │
 ┌──────┼────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┐
 ▼      ▼        ▼              ▼
Company Financial  News      SEC Filing
 Tool     Tool     Tool         Tool
        │
        ▼
 Synthesizer Agent
        │
        ▼
 Verifier Agent
        │
        ▼
 Report Generator
        │
        ▼
 Markdown Report
        │
        ▼
 Streamlit Interface
```

